*Expectation Values of Products:* The expectation value of a product operator of the form $A^dagger A$ in state $bar.v psi chevron.r$ is given by $chevron.l A^dagger A chevron.r = chevron.l A psi bar.v A psi chevron.r$, representing the inner product of the state $A bar.v psi chevron.r$ with itself.
